# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each singer, page, knob and button is said
# once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full); the notes, the face and pressure are not
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Jerry. Sing page: Vowel 50, Head 15 cm, Breath 50, Glide 50. Octave -1. PRESETS: singer, ALGO: vowel
# a page settles before it is said
tap ENV
wait 300
said Envelope page: Attack 0.00 s, Decay 0.00 s, Sustain 100, Release 0.00 s
# a knob: its name and value, once it settles
turn K2 3
wait 300
said Decay 0.15 s
# ALGORITHM: the vowel, from any page
turn ALGO 2
wait 300
said Vowel 54
# the same page button again, and SELECT: the page is said again (the button is answered)
tap ENV
wait 300
said Envelope page
turn SELECT 1
wait 300
said Envelope page
# Touch: every singer's
tap GLO
wait 300
said Touch page, all singers: Pressure VOWEL, Depth 50, Sensitive 50, Velocity 50
turn K1 1
wait 300
said Pressure PITCH
# a singer: its name, and its knobs on the page (not on Touch: they are every singer's)
turn PRESETS 1
wait 300
said Guppo
tap HOME
wait 300
said Sing page: Vowel 50, Head 21 cm, Breath 5, Glide 50
turn PRESETS -1
wait 300
said Jerry, edited. Sing page: Vowel 54
# turning through singers: only where it stops
turn PRESETS 1
turn PRESETS 1
turn PRESETS 1
wait 300
said Suze. Sing page
# singing is for the eye and the ear: nothing is said, pressure or not
key 5 600
wait 200
silent
# the buttons' messages
tap PLAY
said HOLD ON
tap PLAY
said HOLD OFF
tap OCT+
said OCTAVE 0
tap OCT+
said OCTAVE +1
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
said OCTAVE -1
tap SAVE
said SAVED
hold SAVE 1700
said VOICE RESET
# WHERE: everything again
tap FX
wait 300
where
said Suze. Echo page: Amount 80, Time 50. Octave -1. PRESETS: singer, ALGO: vowel
